/**
 * @file ReliefBlob.hpp
 * @brief A window of REAL ground, so a world can stand on measured earth in ring 0.
 *
 * @warning GENERATED. Do not hand-edit -- regenerate with the command below. Two checked-in
 * cartridges in this project drifted into two different hand-maintained layouts because their
 * freshness was checked and nothing could refresh them.
 *
 * @warning A raw array rather than a `.lplknow` image because the kernel links
 * `-lknowledge -lassistant -lengine -lkxx -lk`: a static archive only satisfies references
 * already pending when the linker reaches it, so `libengine` -- where a World lives -- cannot
 * call the image reader. The wire format is exercised host-side in `test-relief`.
 *
 * @author MasterLaplace
 * @version 0.1.0
 * @copyright MIT License
 */

